    "scenesThatPass": [
      "PEBBLES: Mommy, is the bad Ze-ze-zenosaurus gonna get me and eat me up?\nWILMA: Of course not, baby.",
      "BETTY: We're still shopping around.\nWILMA: Fortunately, we're both --\nWILMA & BETTY: -- Professional shoppers!",
      "WILMA: Ah, hello, Mrs. Slate.\nWILMA: We met at the quarry picnic?\nMRS. SLATE: Oh, of course. Mrs. Flintstein.",
      "BETTY: Here we are, Mrs. Slate. Sorry you had to ride in the back.\nMRS. SLATE: Not at all. I'm used to being driven around.",
      "MRS. SLATE: Thank you, Marie. I ordered the hors d'oeuvres for the junior talent show. They were out of Ceolanth caviar so I got Mastodon brie instead. …\nWILMA: Flintstone --\nMRS. SLATE: -- oh, it used to be Flintstein -- ? And this is ah, Becky... Betty!"
    ]
  },
